<title>INDIA: Indian castor trade closed for Hindu festival.</title>
<headline>Indian castor trade closed for Hindu festival.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's castor trade was closed for a local Hindu festival on Thursday, dealers said. It reopens on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, castorseed December delivery opened higher from 1,150/1,151 rupees to 1,153/1,154 rupees but fell to 1,148/1,149 rupees per quintal on fresh speculative offerings at improved levels, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
